<title>USA: Lone Star Tech sets one mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Lone Star Tech sets one mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lone Star Technologies Inc said on Thursday its board of directors authorized the repurchase of one million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Management would determine when to make the purchases, the company said in a statement. It said these shares could be used in its long term incentive plan.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
